  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Fca Us has $512M in contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Fca Us won 11,836 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $43.3K, and obligations are up 101.5% year over year. Fiscal-year obligations vary: FY21 shows $267M, FY22 shows $16.1M, FY23 shows $356M, FY24 shows $330M, FY25 shows $254M, and FY26 shows $512M. The current-year totals are partial, fiscal year to date, and the listed award-value tables use total contract values, while other figures are contract obligations. These numbers show that obligation levels for Fca Us in FY26 are larger than in each prior single fiscal year listed. The award count and average award size reflect many relatively small transactions that sum to the current obligation total. Readers should use the fiscal-year breakdown when comparing yearly activity, because the FY26 figure covers part of the fiscal year rather than a full year.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "How did Fca Us obligations change versus prior years?",
        "body": "Fca Us obligations are up 101.5% year over year. Fca Us recorded $512M in FY26 to date, compared with $254M in FY25 and $330M in FY24. Fca Us obligations peaked in FY23 at $356M before dipping in FY24 and FY25 and then rising to the current FY26 level."
      },
      {
        "heading": "What does the award profile look like for Fca Us this fiscal year?",
        "body": "Fca Us has 11,836 awards in FY26 to date, with an average award size of $43.3K. Fca Us reached $512M in obligations through many relatively small awards rather than a few large awards. Fca Us fiscal-year counts and averages indicate broad transactional activity across the reporting period."
      }
